# Questivo: Project Overview, Engineering Architecture, and Full-Stack Implementation

## 1. System Design Philosophy & Core Problem Definition

**Questivo** is an enterprise-grade, Agentic AI-driven career readiness and assessment ecosystem. It is engineered to solve a prominent bottleneck in educational technology: the automated parsing, generation, and rendering of high-stakes technical assessment questions, comprehensive ATS resume optimizations, and dynamic mock interview modules—all without transport layer formatting crashes, structural layout collapses, or infrastructure limit exhaustion.

The system is split into three foundational modules:

1. **Agentic Test Runner Engine:** Automates the synthesis of multi-concept technical assessment questions mimicking premium exam criteria (e.g., JEE Advanced, GATE, and NDA variants) while enforcing bulletproof LaTeX mathematical typesetting.
2. **ATS Resume Analyzer:** Parses multi-format document templates (PDF/DOCX) using custom token linter hooks to measure keyword alignment, structurally linting resume layouts against semantic parsing configurations.
3. **Generative Mock Interview Studio:** Uses a stateful speech-to-text and text-to-speech asynchronous polling architecture to simulate custom, domain-specific live technical interviews with real-time semantic scoring.

