## 5. ATS Resume Analysis & Live Interview Engineering Workflows

The placement preparation aspect of Questivo bridges the gap between evaluation and industry criteria through two advanced pipelines:

### ATS Analysis Loop

When a candidate uploads a resume file (`.pdf` or `.docx`), `multer` pipes the binary directly into native text extractors. The system extracts raw text boundaries and maps them against the structural data models of target job descriptions. The LLM acts as an extraction agent, scoring match percentages, generating critical semantic suggestions, identifying missing keywords (e.g., specific framework configurations or cloud infrastructure dependencies), and tracking design faults. The output is pushed to the client via Prisma into an interactive Tailwind scorecard grid.

### Generative Mock Interview Studio

This module allows candidates to practice live technical interviews tailored to their target industry role. The engine reads user configuration flags (e.g., Frontend Engineer, System Architect, Embedded Systems) and dynamically initiates an interactive conversation thread. The AI interviewer generates contextual, scenario-based system design or coding questions. The platform captures the candidate's audio responses, converts them into text tokens, and passes them to the evaluation agent. The agent grades each answer across four operational matrices: technical accuracy, code optimization, problem-solving structure, and communication clarity. This data maps out a real-time behavioral performance matrix for the user.

